  FX/vr09-licenses/Saira-OFL.txt https://github.com/AntoineBalaine/perken-reaper-scripts/raw/vr09-v$version/extensions/reaziglib/assets/fonts/Saira-OFL.txt
@changelog
  First release as a ReaPack package.
@link
  Source repository https://github.com/AntoineBalaine/perken-reaper-scripts
@about
  # Perken VR-09

  A CLAP plugin that controls the Roland VR-09: parameters, patches, MIDI and an audio insert.

  ReaPack installs the plugin into UserPlugins/FX, which REAPER does not scan by default. Once, add that folder in Preferences > Plug-ins > CLAP and rescan.
